          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 78173,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aşağıdaki programdaki gibi belirli koşulları ele alan koşullu ifadeleri nasıl yazacağını öğrenelim.</p><webview version=\"2\" visible-if=\"always\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;style&gt;&#xA;   body {&#xA;    text-align: center&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/style&gt;&#xA; &lt;/head&gt;&#xA; &lt;body&gt;&#xA;  &lt;img id=&quot;greetingImage&quot;&#xA;   src=&quot;https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506126383447-1baf4fb3c267?ixlib=rb-1.2.1&amp;ixid=eyJhcHBfaWQiOjEyMDd9&amp;auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=2850&amp;q=80&quot;&#xA;   height=&quot;200px&quot;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h1 id=&quot;greeting&quot;&gt;Good Afternoon&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h3&gt;Time: &lt;span id=&quot;hour&quot;&gt;12&lt;/span&gt;:00&lt;/h3&gt; 0:00 &lt;input id=&quot;slider&quot;&#xA;   type=&quot;range&quot; min=&quot;0&quot; max=&quot;23&quot; oninput=&quot;slide(this.value)&quot;&#xA;   onchange=&quot;slide(this.value)&quot;&gt; 23:00 &lt;script&gt;&#xA;   function slide(value) {&#xA;    const time = document.getElementById(&quot;hour&quot;);&#xA;    time.textContent = value;&#xA;    const image = document.getElementById(&quot;greetingImage&quot;);&#xA;    const greeting = document.getElementById(&quot;greeting&quot;);&#xA;    if (value &lt; 7) {&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;,&#xA;      &quot;https://mimo.app/i/ride-and-shine.png&quot;);&#xA;     greeting.textContent = &quot;Rise and shine&quot;;&#xA;    } else if (value &lt; 12) {&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;, &quot;https://mimo.app/i/good-morning.png&quot;);&#xA;     greeting.textContent = &quot;Good morning&quot;;&#xA;    } else if (value &lt; 17) {&#xA;     greeting.textContent = &quot;Good afternoon&quot;;&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;,&#xA;      &quot;https://mimo.app/i/good-afternoon.png&quot;);&#xA;    } else if (value &lt; 21) {&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;, &quot;https://mimo.app/i/good-evening.png&quot;);&#xA;     greeting.textContent = &quot;Good evening&quot;;&#xA;    } else {&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;, &quot;https://mimo.app/i/good-night.png&quot;);&#xA;     greeting.textContent = &quot;Good night&quot;;&#xA;    }&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/script&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Intro 2",
            "id": 78176,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kaydırıcıyı hareket ettirdiğinde bu program, saat 7'den, 12'den, 17'den ve 21'den küçükse farklı selamlamalar göstermek için koşullu ifadeler kullanır.</p><webview version=\"2\" visible-if=\"always\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;style&gt;&#xA;   body {&#xA;    text-align: center&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/style&gt;&#xA; &lt;/head&gt;&#xA; &lt;body&gt;&#xA;  &lt;img id=&quot;greetingImage&quot;&#xA;   src=&quot;https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506126383447-1baf4fb3c267?ixlib=rb-1.2.1&amp;ixid=eyJhcHBfaWQiOjEyMDd9&amp;auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=2850&amp;q=80&quot;&#xA;   height=&quot;200px&quot;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h1 id=&quot;greeting&quot;&gt;Good Afternoon&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h3&gt;Time: &lt;span id=&quot;hour&quot;&gt;12&lt;/span&gt;:00&lt;/h3&gt; 0:00 &lt;input id=&quot;slider&quot;&#xA;   type=&quot;range&quot; min=&quot;0&quot; max=&quot;23&quot; oninput=&quot;slide(this.value)&quot;&#xA;   onchange=&quot;slide(this.value)&quot;&gt; 23:00 &lt;script&gt;&#xA;   function slide(value) {&#xA;    const time = document.getElementById(&quot;hour&quot;);&#xA;    time.textContent = value;&#xA;    const image = document.getElementById(&quot;greetingImage&quot;);&#xA;    const greeting = document.getElementById(&quot;greeting&quot;);&#xA;    if (value &lt; 7) {&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;,&#xA;      &quot;https://mimo.app/i/ride-and-shine.png&quot;);&#xA;     greeting.textContent = &quot;Rise and shine&quot;;&#xA;    } else if (value &lt; 12) {&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;, &quot;https://mimo.app/i/good-morning.png&quot;);&#xA;     greeting.textContent = &quot;Good morning&quot;;&#xA;    } else if (value &lt; 17) {&#xA;     greeting.textContent = &quot;Good afternoon&quot;;&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;,&#xA;      &quot;https://mimo.app/i/good-afternoon.png&quot;);&#xA;    } else if (value &lt; 21) {&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;, &quot;https://mimo.app/i/good-evening.png&quot;);&#xA;     greeting.textContent = &quot;Good evening&quot;;&#xA;    } else {&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;, &quot;https://mimo.app/i/good-night.png&quot;);&#xA;     greeting.textContent = &quot;Good night&quot;;&#xA;    }&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/script&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Elif",
            "id": 78175,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>if</code> ve <code>else</code> ifadelerini kullanarak, <code>hour</code> değerinin <code>12</code>'den küçük olması durumunda bir selamlama, koşulu karşılamadığında ise başka bir selamlama gösteren bir program yazabiliriz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"hour = \" /><text value=\"9\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good morning&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good night&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"21\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Good morning\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>hour</code>, ardından <code>&lt;</code> ve son olarak <code>12</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu program öğleden önce bir şekilde, diğer durumlarda başka şekilde selamlar.</p><p><code>hour</code> değerini sola koy. <code>12</code>'nin altındayken <code>Good morning</code> yazdıracak koşulu oluştur.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"hour = \" /><text value=\"9\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good morning&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good night&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Good morning\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>hour</code>, ardından <code>&lt;</code> ve son olarak <code>12</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Elif",
            "id": 78177,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Daha özel bir koşul için, örneğin <code>hour</code> değerinin <code>12</code>'den büyük, <strong>ancak</strong><code>17</code>'den küçük olması durumunda, bunun yerine <code>elif hour &lt; 17:</code> yazabiliriz.</p><p><code>elif</code>, else if ifadesinin kısaltmasıdır. <code>elif</code>, <code>if</code> bloğunun koşulu karşılanmadığında kontrol edilmesi gereken ikinci bir koşul olduğunda kullanılır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"hour = \" /><text value=\"14\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good morning&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good afternoon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"63\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Good afternoon\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>elif</code>, ardından <code>hour &lt; 17</code> ve son olarak <code>:</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>elif</code>, <em>else if</em> ifadesinin kısaltmasıdır. <code>if</code> false olduğunda kontrol edilen ikinci koşuldur.</p><p>Sabah kontrolü başarısız oldu. <code>hour</code>, <code>17</code>'den küçükken <code>Good afternoon</code> gösteren dalı ekle.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"hour = \" /><text value=\"14\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good morning&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good afternoon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"else\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"hour &lt; 12\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Good afternoon\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>elif</code>, ardından <code>hour &lt; 17</code> ve son olarak <code>:</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Elif",
            "id": 78163,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><strong>elif ifadesi</strong>, kendisinden önceki koşullar <code>False</code> olduğunda ve <code>hour &lt; 17</code> gibi kendi koşulu <code>True</code> olduğunda kod bloğunu çalıştırır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"hour = \" /><text value=\"14\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good morning&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good afternoon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"62\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Good afternoon\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>hour &lt; 17</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Else statement",
            "id": 78162,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>if</code> ve <code>elif</code> koşulları <code>False</code> olduğunda kod bloğunu çalıştırmak için bir <code>else</code> ifadesi kodlayabiliriz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"hour = \" /><text value=\"18\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good morning&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good afternoon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good night&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"94\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Good night\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>else</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "As many as we'd like",
            "id": 78174,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>else</code> ifadesinden önce geldikleri sürece istediğimiz kadar <code>elif</code> ifadesi ekleyebiliriz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"hour = \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good morning&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good afternoon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"21\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good evening&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good night&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"94\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Good evening\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>elif</code>, ardından <code>elif</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Son <code>else</code> ifadesinden önce istediğin kadar <code>elif</code> dalı ekleyebilirsin.</p><p>İki orta dalı, <code>hour</code> değeri <code>20</code> olduğunda konsol <code>Good evening</code> gösterecek şekilde doldur.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"hour = \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good morning&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good afternoon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"21\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good evening&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good night&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"94\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"else\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Good evening\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>elif</code>, ardından <code>elif</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Adding elif",
            "id": 78161,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu kod konsolda ne görüntüler?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"number = \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Less than five&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Less than ten&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Less than ten\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Less than ten</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Less than five</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Less than ten</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu kod neden <code>Less than ten</code> görüntüler?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"number = \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Less than five&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Less than ten&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Less than ten\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>number &lt; 5</code>, <code>False</code>, ardından <code>number &lt; 10</code>, <code>True</code> olur.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">İki koşul da <code>True</code> olur, ancak <code>elif</code> bloğu <code>if</code> çıktısının yerini alır.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Bir <code>elif</code> ardından geldiğinde Python <code>if</code> koşulunu atlar.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>number &lt; 5</code>, <code>False</code>, ardından <code>number &lt; 10</code>, <code>True</code> olur.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: elif keyword",
            "id": 78160,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu kod konsolda ne görüntüler?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"score = \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score &gt;= \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You got an A!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score &gt;= \" /><text value=\"70\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You passed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"You passed\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>You passed</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>A aldın!</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>You passed</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu kod neden <code>You got an A!</code> yerine <code>You passed</code> görüntüler?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"score = \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score &gt;= \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You got an A!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score &gt;= \" /><text value=\"70\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You passed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"You passed\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>score &gt;= 90</code>, <code>False</code>, ancak <code>score &gt;= 70</code>, <code>True</code> olur.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">İki koşul da <code>True</code> olduğu için Python yalnızca <code>elif</code> bloğunu çalıştırır.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>elif</code> bloğu Python <code>if</code> koşulunu kontrol etmeden önce çalışır.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>score &gt;= 90</code>, <code>False</code>, ancak <code>score &gt;= 70</code>, <code>True</code> olur.</p></body></html>"
