            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>if</code> ifadesinin ve <code>elif</code> ifadelerinin koşulları <code>False</code> döndürdüğünde ne olur?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"score = \" /><text value=\"66\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score &gt; \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You get an A!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score &gt; \" /><text value=\"70\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You passed!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Better luck next time!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Better luck next time!\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>else</code> ifadesinin kod bloğu çalışır</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Hiçbir şey olmuyor</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>else</code> ifadesinin kod bloğu çalışır.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>if</code> ve <code>elif</code> koşullarının ikisi de <code>False</code> olduğunda <code>else</code> bloğu çalışır.</p><p>Aşağıdaki çıktı <code>score = 66</code> içindir. <code>score</code> bunun yerine <code>80</code> olsaydı hangi blok çalışırdı?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"score = \" /><text value=\"66\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score &gt; \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You get an A!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score &gt; \" /><text value=\"70\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You passed!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Better luck next time!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Better luck next time!\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>elif</code> bloğu <code>You passed!</code> yazdırır.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>if</code> bloğu <code>You get an A!</code> yazdırır.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>else</code> bloğu <code>Better luck next time!</code> yazdırır.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>elif</code> bloğu <code>You passed!</code> yazdırır.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
