            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir <code>if</code> deyimine ekleyebileceğimiz maksimum <code>elif</code> deyimi sayısı kaçtır?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Maksimum sayı yoktur</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">10</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Maksimum sayı yoktur.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir <code>if</code> ifadesine ekleyebileceğimiz <code>elif</code> ifadelerinin maksimum sayısı yoktur.</p><p>Programın ilk koşuldan sonra sıralı on iki puan aralığına ihtiyacı var. Geliştirici ne yapabilir?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Aynı zincire on iki <code>elif</code> dalı ekleyebilir.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Zincir daha uzun olamayacağı için yalnızca on <code>elif</code> dalı ekleyebilir.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Uzun zincirler yedek dal gerektirdiği için her <code>elif</code> yerine <code>else</code> koyabilir.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Aynı zincire on iki <code>elif</code> dalı ekleyebilir.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Adding elif",
            "id": 78157,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>age</code> değeri <code>12</code>'den büyük ve <code>16</code>'ya eşit veya küçük olduğunda bir <code>elif</code> ifadesi kodlayarak konsolda bir mesaj görüntüle.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"age = \" /><text value=\"16\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age &lt;= \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Where are your parents?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age &lt;= \" /><text value=\"16\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You're too young to ride this ride.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Welcome!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"else\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"You're too young to ride this ride.\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>elif</code>, ardından <code>age &lt;= 16</code> ve son olarak <code>:</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>age</code>, <code>12</code>'den büyük ve <code>16</code>'ya kadar olduğunda <code>You're too young to ride this ride.</code> gösteren orta dalı ekle.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"age = \" /><text value=\"16\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age &lt;= \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Where are your parents?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age &lt;= \" /><text value=\"16\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You're too young to ride this ride.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Welcome!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"else\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"age &lt; 16\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"You're too young to ride this ride.\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>elif</code>, ardından <code>age &lt;= 16</code> ve son olarak <code>:</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
